certain widgets — are developed in a separate, private repository under
proprietary terms and are NOT covered by this LICENSE. An official Bevel build
may therefore combine Apache-2.0 code from here with proprietary code from
elsewhere; the Apache-2.0 grant applies to the former and confers no rights in
the latter.

